hthouse","note":"A lighthouse to serve as a beacon for ships in the open sea."},{"icon":"glyph-27f1","type":"waterfalls","dy":54,"px":16,"x":917.02,"y":224.38,"cell":1478,"i":19,"name":"Bribellere Waterfall","note":"A gorgeous waterfall flows here."},{"icon":"glyph-27f1","type":"waterfalls","dy":54,"px":16,"x":1090.91,"y":363.11,"cell":2654,"i":20,"name":"Thermenelian Waterfall","note":"An impressive waterfall has cut through the land."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":829.85,"y":162.68,"cell":782,"i":21,"name":"Tethedon Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Alardosian War. \r\nDate: July 26, 1381 Orlowbig Era."},{"icon":"glyph-2694-fe0f","type":"battlefields","dy":52,"x":518.82,"y":421.77,"cell":3164,"i":22,"name":"Porvena Battlefield","note":"A historical battle of the Cecavig Crusade. \r\nDate: January 26, 1774 Orlowbig Era."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":580.29,"y":200.84,"cell":1213,"i":23,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3337931471213\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3337931471213\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":884.8,"y":426.4,"cell":3183,"i":24,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3337931473183\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3337931473183\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":1132.2,"y":432.6,"cell":3345,"i":25,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3337931473345\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=3337931473345\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5dd-fe0f","type":"dungeons","dy":51,"px":13,"x":931.32,"y":83.36,"cell":299,"i":26,"name":"Dungeon","note":"<div>Undiscovered dungeon. See <a href=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=333793147299\" target=\"_blank\">One page dungeon</a></div><iframe style=\"pointer-events: none;\" src=\"https://watabou.github.io/one-page-dungeon/?seed=333793147299\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f409","type":"lake-monsters","dy":48,"x":484.75,"y":301.13,"cell":2048,"i":27,"name":"Eskimioki Monster","note":"Rumors say a relic monster of 9 m long inhabits Eskimioki Lake. Truth or lie, folks are afraid to fish in the lake."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":644.6,"y":525.6,"cell":4602,"i":28,"name":"Keley Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 11 m long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f991","type":"sea-monsters","x":985.51,"y":285.34,"cell":1938,"i":29,"name":"Ormswest Monster","note":"Old sailors tell stories of a gigantic sea monster inhabiting these dangerous waters. Rumors say it can be 37 m long."},{"icon":"glyph-1f479","type":"hill-monsters","dy":54,"px":13,"x":1032.37,"y":198.51,"cell":1273,"i":30,"name":"Barcy Undead","note":"Locals speak of a superior Undead who inhabits Barcy hills and harasses travelers in the area."},{"icon":"glyph-1f333","type":"sacred-forests","x":1060.58,"y":81.32,"cell":261,"i":31,"name":"Oresk Forest","note":"A forest sacred to local Slovan Religion."},{"icon":"glyph-1f332","type":"sacred-pineries","px":13,"x":1014.4,"y":98.24,"cell":362,"i":32,"name":"Mamougy Pinery","note":"A pinery sacred to local Luari Beliefs."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1013.65,"y":487.2,"cell":4213,"i":33,"name":"Lamphossos Wolverines","note":"A gang of forest brigands."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":1102.04,"y":375.88,"cell":2774,"i":34,"name":"Helion Sharks","note":"A gang of swamp highwaymen."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4b0","type":"brigands","px":13,"x":485.4,"y":288,"cell":1915,"i":35,"name":"Kijarjaki Badgers","note":"A gang of swamp robbers."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":783,"y":215.1,"cell":1356,"i":36,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":541.07,"y":495.26,"cell":4146,"i":37,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":497.7,"y":373.4,"cell":2606,"i":38,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3f4-200d-2620-fe0f","type":"pirates","dx":51,"x":781.12,"y":120.59,"cell":454,"i":39,"name":"Pirates","note":"Pirate ships have been spotted in these waters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":421.56,"y":226.24,"cell":1408,"i":40,"name":"Pogni Column","note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ፈለ  አሀ   ጸፀፈጰኀዘ ጰገመፐ  ነዐኀጸወአተየሀረወጰበአከአሐፀአዐወዐ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":384.9,"y":561.1,"cell":5069,"i":41,"name":"Kelva Obelisk","note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༒༜༷༣༼་༭༵༦༹༱༳༜༓༩༸༠༳༯༹༸༺༃༽༪༺༾༃༉༹༴༵༪༄༯༔༪༙༚༃༫༱༬༸༈༻༆༢༄༭</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1095.1,"y":32.9,"cell":103,"i":42,"name":"Ruined Pyramid","note":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1083.47,"y":541.45,"cell":4880,"i":43,"name":"Ruined Stronghold","note":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4da","type":"libraries","x":1097.34,"y":555.05,"cell":5006,"i":44,"name":"Kalcis Library","note":"A vast collection of knowledge, including many rare and ancient tomes."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":418.34,"y":509.49,"cell":4432,"i":45,"name":"Travelling Fantastical Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this fantastical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":598.3,"y":186.7,"cell":986,"i":46,"name":"Travelling Magical Circus","note":"Roll up, roll up, this magical circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":1098.9,"y":64.46,"cell":215,"i":47,"name":"Kavetsla Tournament","note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a tournament of speed in Kavetsla, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":1114.5,"y":99.58,"cell":377,"i":48,"name":"Penkhamp Fair","note":"A fair is being held in Penkhamp, offering local preserved food, coal, and arms alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":731.98,"y":204.9,"cell":1238,"i":49,"name":"Minor Jetty","note":"A small location along the Wicksey River to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":1341.09,"y":443.32,"cell":3497,"i":50,"name":"Crocodiles migration","note":"A huge group of crocodiles are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":963.1,"y":193,"cell":1151,"i":51,"name":"Benay Cavern","note":"The Benay Cavern. Locals claim that it is slowly filling with lava."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":1080.69,"y":470.27,"cell":3900,"i":52,"name":"Bolis Tomb","note":"This ethereal necropolis seems suspended between the realms of the living and the dead. Wisps of mist dance around the tombstones, while haunting melodies linger in the air, commemorating the departed."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1324.66,"y":395.05,"cell":3005,"i":53,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/3005\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":267.28,"y":343.33,"cell":2261,"i":54,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2261\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1263.25,"y":501.52,"cell":4391,"i":55,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/4391\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":338.51,"y":361.83,"cell":2582,"i":56,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2582\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":951.1,"y":187.8,"cell":1030,"i":57,"name":"Random encounter","note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/1030\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f6a9","type":"party","size":46,"pin":"pin","fill":"#ffffff","stroke":"#d4351c","x":1040.64,"y":61.22,"cell":168,"i":58,"name":"The Party","note":"Current location of the adventuring party."}]
